{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuwen-e-35dfaac3ab0aff00b91b","title":"曹叡诏封曹茂聊城王","accounts":[{"id":"wuwen-a-35dfaac3ab0aff00b91b","label":"正文","text":"曹叡诏封曹茂聊城王","evidence":["wuwen-q-76daf1b1e8ceda304eec"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuwen-p-55ebf5222bc39d","role":"受封或迁封者","evidence":["wuwen-q-76daf1b1e8ceda304eec"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原句纪年见引文，未审定公元年。","evidence":["wuwen-q-76daf1b1e8ceda304eec"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuwen-q-76daf1b1e8ceda304eec","order":4039}],"persons":[{"id":"wuwen-p-55ebf5222bc39d","name":"曹茂","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuwen-q-76daf1b1e8ceda304eec","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-86971c5822d3ccf77a3e","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年，徙封聊城公，其年为王。诏曰：“昔象之为虐至甚〖5〗，而大舜犹侯之有庳〖6〗；近汉氏淮南、阜陵〖7〗，皆为乱臣逆子，而犹或及身而复国〖8〗，或至子而锡土。有虞，建之于上古；汉文、明、章，行之乎前代〖9〗：斯皆敦叙亲亲之厚义也。聊城公茂，少不闲礼教，长不务善道。先帝以为古之立诸侯也，皆命贤者，故姬姓有未必侯者；是以独不王茂。太皇太后，数以为言。如闻茂〖10〗，顷来少知悔昔之非，欲修善将来。君子与其进〖11〗，不保其往也。今封茂为聊城王，以慰太皇太后下流之念。”","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":235,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
